found.uninstall_consequences:
Only what we installed will be removed:
• TrustTunnel itself and all its settings;
• the server's TLS certificate;
• the certificate auto-renewal task;
• the firewall rule we added.

System packages (curl, certbot) and your other data are NOT touched.

The current VPN connection will be terminated.

